Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.00,0:04:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第2季第18集]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.34,0:07:56.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对 把其中一个手柄放那里 可以{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, one of the grips left that. That's good right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.39,0:07:59.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,朋友们 过来 对 开始 了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys. Come here. All right, let's go, people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.52,0:08:00.52,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.68,0:08:03.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,所以当塔拉说她的台词时 我就向前走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So when Tara's saying her lines, can I step forward...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.39,0:08:06.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,然后让这个新的地方成为我的新标记？对对对 随你便{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and make this new spot my new mark? Sure, sure, sure, treat yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.06,0:08:09.52,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,继续 请安静{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead. Quiet, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.03,0:08:19.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,安静 准备计时{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quiet, hold the bell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.70,0:08:21.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,灯光{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.20,0:08:22.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,控制噪音 我们在拍摄{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold the noise, we're rolling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.93,0:00:23.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,米奇？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mitch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:26.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,阿什利？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ashley?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.23,0:00:28.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们在吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You out here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.11,0:00:36.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,拜托 伙计们{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.78,0:00:38.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们在哪儿？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.04,0:00:43.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有人吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.46,0:00:47.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有人吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.88,0:00:55.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,布洛迪 阿什利和托德 他们死了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Brodie. - Ashley and Todd, they're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:56.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,温蒂 他们死了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wendy, they're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:59.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,布洛迪 我们得团结起来 我们没有机会 知道吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull it together. - Pull it together? We don't have a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.60,0:01:02.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们得离开这里 马上 不行 布洛迪 我们不能走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We have to get out of here. - No, we are not leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.31,0:01:04.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们得找到我姐姐 不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We have got to find my sister. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.73,0:01:07.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 我现在就要离开这里 布洛迪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, I am getting out of here right now. - Brodie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.48,0:01:10.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,布洛迪 给我回来 布洛迪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brodie get back here! Brodie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.40,0:01:12.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,老天 你个混球{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, you son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.34,0:01:38.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,停机 见鬼的这是什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut. What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.18,0:01:42.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,谢了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.27,0:01:46.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,给你的 谢了 沃尔特{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go. - Thanks, Walter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.35,0:01:48.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,别… 别记录那个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't mark that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.31,0:01:53.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,都很不错 泰拉 非常棒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all good, Tara. That was great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.19,0:01:54.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嗯 我们再来一遍{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, let's do it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.69,0:01:58.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嗯 也许我们该提高那声尖叫？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, maybe we try dialing up that scream, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.36,0:02:01.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道 我只是… 只是那个网球让我无法集中{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, I know. I'm just-I'm having trouble with the tennis ball.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.62,0:02:03.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你知道 那只是为摄像机聚准用的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you know what? That is for CG registration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.70,0:02:07.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,当伊万和做特效的同僚弄好之后 将会看起来非常恐怖{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, when Ivan and the FX guys are done, it is going to look terrifying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.79,0:02:12.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你还要再看一下剧情概括吗？不用了 没关系 我会找到感觉的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wanna look at the concept sketches again? - No, that's okay. I'll find it, I'll find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.63,0:02:14.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我知道你会的 亲爱的 恩？好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you will, huh? Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.55,0:02:20.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,再来一次 伙计们 10分钟调试镜头和音效{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Going again, everybody. Ten-minute reload for camera and sound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.34,0:02:24.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 朋友 我告诉你 一个人在布景后面或者收工后干活…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, man. I'm telling you, working alone behind the sets or after wrap...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.64,0:02:27.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有时我会有种古怪的感觉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - ...I catch this weird vibe sometimes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.23,0:02:29.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,像哪种的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, like what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.23,0:02:30.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,呒… 像被什么东西注视着{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like something's watching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.81,0:02:33.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,算了吧 嘿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. - Hey...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.90,0:02:37.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就像拍摄这样的电影？古怪的谣言一定会有的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}working on a movie like this, weird crap's bound to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.07,0:02:41.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,弗兰克认为场景有鬼魂出没 就像 真的一样{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frankie thinks the stage is haunted. Like, for real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.16,0:02:47.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我说的一切 他们称为胡扯 一旦完工 我就离开这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I'm saying is, they call wrap, I get done and I get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.91,0:02:50.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迅速的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.67,0:02:58.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那家伙肯定是疯了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That guy is definitely off his meds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.26,0:03:05.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,布洛迪 回来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brodie, come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.51,0:03:06.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你个混球{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.27,0:03:16.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,布洛迪 回来 你个混球{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brodie, come back, you son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.03,0:03:22.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有人吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.33,0:03:30.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,伙计们？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.29,0:03:37.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 这不好玩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, it's not funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.21,0:03:40.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.47,0:03:42.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哈哈 很有趣{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha-ha. Very funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.97,0:03:49.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有人吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.31,0:03:54.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,谁在那里？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.12,0:04:15.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这就是我想听到的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, that's what I'm talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.31,0:04:34.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,1927年开园以来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First opened in 1927...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.19,0:04:36.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在80年间一直都在{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the lot has been in continuous operation...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.94,0:04:38.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,持续运作{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for eight decades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.90,0:04:41.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嗨 你知道这里就是拍的地方吗？(1982年美国电影){\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you know this is where they filmed Creepshow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.95,0:04:47.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,现在右手边这里就是星谷{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, to the right here is Stars Hollow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.45,0:04:51.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是电视剧的摄影棚{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the setting for the television series Gilmore Girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.41,0:04:54.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果我们幸运的话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if we're lucky, we might even catch...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.71,0:04:56.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,甚至能一睹几个电视剧的明星{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one of the show's stars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.04,0:04:58.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.21,0:04:59.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,先逛完再说啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's finish the tour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.63,0:05:01.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,然后这里是纽约大道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then up to the right here we have...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.17,0:05:06.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就是在这儿取景的 (1993年美国电影){\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New York Avenue, and that's where they shot Lois and Clark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.22,0:05:13.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆 快看 是马特达蒙{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, check it out, it's Matt Damon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.52,0:05:17.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧 我很确信他不是马特达蒙 是 是他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, pretty sure that's not Matt Damon. - No, it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.19,0:05:20.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那好 马特达蒙刚刚 捡起扫帚开始扫街{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Matt Damon just picked up a broom and started sweeping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.23,0:05:22.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 他可能正在研究 一个角色或什么的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he's probably researching a role or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.40,0:05:24.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我可不这么看{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.90,0:05:27.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嗨 这边 我想第9摄影棚在那里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, this way. Uh, I think Stage 9's over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.74,0:05:30.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,来吧 伙计 继续走这路 不 过来 我们得干活了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, man. Let's keep going this way. - No, come on, we gotta work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.87,0:05:34.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,天那 伙计 是你要来的洛杉矶 是啊 来休假的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanted to come to L.A. Yeah, for vacation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.25,0:05:37.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我的意思是游泳池和电影明星 不是工作{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, swimming pools and movie stars. Not to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.29,0:05:39.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是不是游泳池才适合你 迪恩？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does this seem like swimming-pool weather to you, Dean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.04,0:05:42.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,实际上是加拿大人 是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I mean, it's practically Canadian. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.75,0:05:45.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我刚刚意识到 你知道的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just figured that after everything that happened with...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.76,0:05:48.05,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,麦迪逊事件之后 你也许应该休息恢复一下 仅此而已{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madison, you could use a little R and R.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.22,0:05:50.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许我只想工作 迪恩 也许这可以让我的注意力 不集中在那件事上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, maybe I wanna work. It keeps my mind off things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.89,0:05:52.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 好的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Okay. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.85,0:05:55.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么这个工作人员 他… 他是死在摄影棚里的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this crew guy, what did he-? He died on set?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.48,0:05:58.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 谣言如燎原般传的飞快{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, rumor's spreading like wildfire online.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.77,0:06:00.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他们说摄影棚常有鬼魂出没{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're saying the set's haunted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.86,0:06:02.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,促狭鬼？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, like Poltergeist?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.65,0:06:06.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,可能是促狭鬼 不 不 不 是电影{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Could be a poltergeist. - No, no, no. The movie Poltergeist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.32,0:06:09.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你对文化遗产一无所知 是吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know nothing of your cultural heritage, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.36,0:06:11.99,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,谣传拍摄的摄影棚被诅咒了的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was rumored that the set of Poltergeist was cursed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.16,0:06:15.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他们用人骨做道具{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That they used real human bones as, uh, props.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.54,0:06:18.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好像至少有3个演员死在那里了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, at least three of the actors died in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.79,0:06:21.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 也许有那样的事情{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it might be something like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.42,0:06:23.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧 那个工作人员 他叫什么名字？弗兰克迦夫{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So this crew guy, what's his name? - Frank Jaffy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.96,0:06:26.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你拿到死亡证明或者 是验尸官报告了吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frank Jaffy, you got a death certificate or a coroner's report?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.09,0:06:30.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 但这是洛杉矶 明白吗？那可能不是他的真名{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, no, but, uh, it's L.A., you know? Might not even be his real name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.84,0:06:33.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但发现尸体的那个女孩说她 看到了些东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the girl who found him, she said she saw something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.55,0:06:34.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,若应若现的影子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A vanishing figure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.81,0:06:36.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那女孩叫什么？泰拉本斯莉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's the girl's name? - Uh, Tara Benchley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.81,0:06:38.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,泰拉本斯莉？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, whoa, whoa. Tara Benchley?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.19,0:06:41.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那个饰演和 的泰拉本斯莉？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From FeardotCom and Ghost Ship, Tara Benchley?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.85,0:06:43.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,伙计 干嘛不早说？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, why didn't you say so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.15,0:06:46.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你现在突然进入角色了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, so now you're suddenly onboard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.86,0:06:50.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我想说 我是她的影迷{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just-I mean, I'm a fan of her work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.82,0:06:52.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这真不错{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.03,0:06:57.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 你看 别弄错了 在工作室的每个人都 热爱自己的工作{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, don't get me wrong. Everyone at the studio loves the dailies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.00,0:07:01.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,包括我自己 我只是期望如果能…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Myself included. We were just wondering if it could be...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.71,0:07:03.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你懂的 再亮一点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you know, a little brighter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.34,0:07:06.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,再亮一点？是的 杰伊 多一点色彩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Brighter? - Yeah, Jay. More color.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.13,0:07:09.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,麦克基 你知道我在说什么 你是这种问题的专家{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McG, you know what I'm saying. You're the master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.88,0:07:13.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,布莱德 这是部恐怖片 谁说恐怖就一定要阴暗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Brad, this is a horror movie. - And who says horror has to be dark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.43,0:07:16.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这有种压抑的感觉 你不这么觉得吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just-It's sort of depressing. Don't you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.26,0:07:18.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嗯 不好意思 那个穿绿衬衫的朋友{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, excuse me, uh, green-shirt guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.14,0:07:20.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对 对 是你 过来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah, you, come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.52,0:07:24.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你能从小店给我买{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you get me a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.31,0:07:25.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一杯奶昔吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}uh, smoothie from craft?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.19,0:07:28.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你要从谁那里买什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want a what from who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.03,0:07:33.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你是个私人助理 这是你要做的事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a PA. This is what you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.24,0:07:35.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好的 好的 他… 呃…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah, he, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.53,0:07:36.99,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一杯奶昔马上就来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One smoothie coming right up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.21,0:07:44.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么是私人助理？我想某种意义上就是奴隶{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's a PA? - I think they're kind of like slaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.04,0:07:49.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他们什么样人的 都会请进来干活 恩？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll let anybody into this business, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.79,0:08:26.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,6章6场6幕 开始{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six, take six. Mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.05,0:08:30.05,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,准备{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.21,0:08:34.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们为什么不从 "来吧 这会很有趣的"这里开始？开机{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't we take it from "Come on, it'll be fun." And action.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.18,0:08:36.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,来吧 这会很有趣的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, it'll be fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.59,0:09:11.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许你明天能搞定{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you can finish this tomorrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.46,0:09:13.05,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,老天 现在我真的很恨你 停机{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I hate you so much right now. - Cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.38,0:09:16.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,非常好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.47,0:09:20.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,所以呢？哪里都找不到电动势信号{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So? - No EMF anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.39,0:09:21.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,太棒了 那么 你怎么看？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. So, what do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.97,0:09:24.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我认为作为一个 私人助理很差劲{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I think being a PA sucks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.81,0:09:29.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看这些人吃的东西？简直是在跟我开玩笑… 你看看这些吃的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the food these people get, are you kidding me? Look at these things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.98,0:09:33.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,它们就像是 迷你菲利牛排干酪三明治 它们很美味{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're like miniature Philly cheesesteak sandwiches. Their delicious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.90,0:09:36.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许晚些时候吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:41.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那个死亡的工作人员你查出什么了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you find out about the dead crew guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.37,0:09:46.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,呃… 弗兰克·迦夫那天第一次上班{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, Frank Jaffy was just filling in for the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.66,0:09:48.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这里没有人认识他和知道他住在哪里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody here knew him or where he lived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.00,0:09:50.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不错 你找到的和我一样多{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, great. So you found out as much as I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.04,0:09:52.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 不是我… - 嗨 伙计们{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not quite I-Hey, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.50,0:09:53.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 嗨{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.01,0:09:55.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,它们很棒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're wonderful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.67,0:09:58.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,听着 我的确找到了一些关于 9号摄影棚的历史资料{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I did dig up some stuff about Stage 9's history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:09:59.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.72,0:10:01.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,过去的80年里有4人死在这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four people died messy here over 80 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.68,0:10:03.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,两起自杀和两起致命事故{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two suicides and two fatal accidents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.60,0:10:06.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 当中的每一个都可能是复仇的鬼魂 - 是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Any of those could be a vengeful spirit. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.93,0:10:08.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,只是得把范围缩小一点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just gotta narrow it down more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.19,0:10:15.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我马上就去处理这个问题{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get right on that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.20,0:10:29.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你是不是也应该拿一份这个？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you supposed to get one of these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.75,0:10:36.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我… 我真的不知道自己应该做什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't really know what I'm doing so-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.38,0:10:38.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,第一天？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.55,0:10:40.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 我的新开始{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, my big break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.85,0:10:46.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我知道这样说真的不合适 但我是一个狂热的影迷{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I know it's really uncool to say this, but I'm a big fan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.89,0:10:48.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我非常喜欢你在"超灵恶巫"中的表演{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I loved you in Boogeyman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.27,0:10:50.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 上帝啊 糟透了的剧本{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God. What a terrible script.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.40,0:10:54.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是 谢谢你 是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, but thank you. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.73,0:10:59.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你发现了他 对吗 那个死了的人？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You found him, right, the dead guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.24,0:11:06.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,很抱歉 你可能并不想谈及这个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, you probably don't wanna talk about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.91,0:11:08.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 没有 事实上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, actually it's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.37,0:11:12.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这… 这没关系的 这里没什么人会过多的谈起那件事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay, but nobody around here really brings it up very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.21,0:11:15.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我想他们都吓坏了 我都快有些精神崩溃了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think they're all scared I'm gonna have some kind of breakdown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.67,0:11:17.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那一定是非常可怕{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That must have been awful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.63,0:11:21.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.09,0:11:23.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那非常恐怖{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was horrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.10,0:11:28.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,很多的血… 从他的眼睛流出来…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There-There was all this blood coming from his eyes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.72,0:11:31.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,从他的嘴里流出来… 还有 呃…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and from his mouth, and, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.81,0:11:34.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我还看到了这个 呃…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw this, um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.57,0:11:38.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.86,0:11:43.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我看到幽灵幻象{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw this shape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.62,0:11:47.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,告诉你实话… 我不知道我到底{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To tell you the truth, I don't know actually...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.20,0:11:49.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看到了什么 我只是知道我看到了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what I saw. I just know I saw it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.45,0:11:51.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 给你 塔拉 - 谢谢 沃尔特{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here you go, Tara. - Thanks, Walter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:58.96,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么这个… 这个叫弗兰克的工作人员 你跟他熟吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, so this crew guy, Frank. I mean, did you know him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.13,0:12:00.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 不太熟悉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, no. Not that well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.76,0:12:03.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这很古怪 好像这里没有谁 真正熟悉那个家伙{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's funny. It's like no one around here actually knew the guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.05,0:12:06.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我有他的照片 - 你有吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I've got his picture. Um... - You do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.10,0:12:09.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 我给每个工作人员都照了快照{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I take Polaroid's of all the crew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.14,0:12:12.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,只是那些在拍戏的时候… 你用来消磨时间所做的事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just one of those things you do to kill time on set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.15,0:12:17.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就在那里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.49,0:12:24.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,狗娘养的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.50,0:12:34.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 杰勒德圣詹姆士？- 有什么事？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gerard St. James? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.96,0:12:36.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你还活着{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.29,0:12:39.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你不是弗兰克·迦夫 - 呃… 不是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And you're not Frank Jaffy. Uh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.17,0:12:43.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你曾经… 曾经在 中饰演过4号沙漠士兵{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were Desert Soldier #4 in Metalstorm: Destruction of Jared-Syn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.76,0:12:45.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 我知道我认出了你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I was. I knew I recognized you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.51,0:12:48.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是个狂热的影迷{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am a huge fan. Ha-ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.97,0:12:51.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是说 你转身就变成了飞船事故的受害者{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your turn as a tractor-crash victim in Critters 3?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.52,0:12:52.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 怪物3 - 哇哦{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Critters 3. - Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.18,0:12:55.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 好的 请 请进{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - All right, well, please. Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.82,0:13:05.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.99,0:13:09.87,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 是制片人… 我是说 他们把我带过去 去装扮成弗兰克的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it was the producers. I mean, they brought me in for the day to play Frank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.03,0:13:13.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 只是想伪造你的死亡？- 影片的造势而已…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just to fake your death? - Well, rumors of a haunted film set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.95,0:13:17.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,免费的宣传 尤其是当你在拍摄 一部恐怖片的时候{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Free publicity. Especially when you're making a horror movie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.54,0:13:20.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是说这会儿 事情已经在互联网上传遍了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, uh, it's already all over the Internet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.50,0:13:22.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 我们知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.17,0:13:26.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这个时代 充斥了新媒体的概念 宣传造势{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, these days, it's all about new media. Building buzz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.84,0:13:28.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他们说{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:30.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是新的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the new Lonelygirl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.72,0:13:33.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 谁？- 那么泰拉看到的鬼影呢？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who? - And the ghost Tara saw?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.22,0:13:35.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,通过发射器放射到屏幕上的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Projected on a screen of diffusion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.02,0:13:39.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这样的扰乱演员的精神… 是不是有些残酷了呢？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't that kind of cruel? Messing with their heads like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.11,0:13:43.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我只是扮演角色 我不写剧本{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I just play the part. I don't write the script.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.86,0:13:47.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,说到这个… 下个月在哥斯达米加…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speaking of, I'm playing Willy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.70,0:13:51.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,的独立影院中上映的一部 名为的电影中… 我饰演威利{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a dinner-theater production of Salesman at Costa Mesa all next month.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.41,0:13:54.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,带着这个礼卷会得到 一份免费的胡椒牛排{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get a free pepper steak with the coupon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.79,0:13:56.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,等一下…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.21,0:13:59.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果你在公共场所露面 难道不会让造势不攻自破吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if you're seen in public, won't that ruin the hoax?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.17,0:14:00.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 拜托{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. Ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.92,0:14:03.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,弗兰克和威利 完全不同的角色{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frank and Willy, totally different characters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.42,0:14:05.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,知道吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.97,0:14:09.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,非常感谢你 圣杰姆斯先生 虽然他一直唠叨不休{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks very much, Mr. St. James. It was just nagging at us, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.43,0:14:11.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是我们… 我们非常高兴… 你知道的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we're very glad that, you know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.35,0:14:13.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你还活着并且很好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're alive and well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.93,0:14:15.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.77,0:14:18.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,毫无疑问{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.39,0:14:22.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我想问问你… 和理查德·摩尔一起工作感觉如何？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, uh, I wanted to ask you, what was it like working with Richard Moll?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.15,0:14:30.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,金属风暴 他饰演希拉克 独眼巨人族的国王{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Metalstorm. He was Hurok, king of the Cyclops people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.16,0:14:33.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,绅士中的绅士{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentleman's gentleman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.70,0:14:34.17,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.95,0:14:38.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好的 胡椒牛排{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Pepper steak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.29,0:14:44.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们一定是在读那本书的时候… 把他们引回来了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we read from that book, we must've brought them back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.55,0:14:45.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,从地狱中引回来了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back from hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.22,0:14:50.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这无所谓{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.59,0:14:53.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在我们找到温蒂和她的妹妹之前 我们哪儿也不去 明白了吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not going anywhere until we find Wendy and her sister. Got it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.01,0:14:56.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,很好 现在 让我们大家都忙起来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Now, let's get busy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.97,0:14:57.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,停机{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.14,0:14:59.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,非常好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very nice work. Mark it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.48,0:15:01.52,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,声音不对 我听到了某种回声{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No good for sound. I'm getting some kind of feedback.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.69,0:15:04.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,回到第一个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back to one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.69,0:15:06.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,又一个昂贵的声音延迟{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another costly sound delay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.61,0:15:10.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 好了 大伙 我们要再录制一遍声音 - 谢谢大家{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're going again for sound, people. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.45,0:15:13.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 你瞧 这是很棒的一场 真的 不同凡响{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, look, see, it's great scene. Really. Dynamite...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.87,0:15:17.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是我还是有一些… 不… 不是问题 只是些疑问{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I still got a few-Not-Not problems, just questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.79,0:15:19.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,像哪种的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.66,0:15:20.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,其中一件事是…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, for one thing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.04,0:15:23.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,剧情的规则不太适合我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the rules aren't really landing for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.88,0:15:28.96,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,比如 当孩子们咏唱拉丁圣歌的时候… 那样就会让鬼魂出现吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, the kids do this Latin chant and that makes the ghost show up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.13,0:15:30.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.30,0:15:33.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果鬼魂在地狱中 他们是如何听到圣歌的呢？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, but if the ghosts are in hell, how do they hear the chanting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.26,0:15:35.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我意思是 如何听到的 他们有顺风耳吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, what, do they have super hearing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.93,0:15:38.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这是个逻辑上的矛盾 剧情的规则没有逻辑可循{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's a logic bump. The rules don't track.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.23,0:15:41.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,马蒂 你是作者{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marty, you're the writer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.64,0:15:43.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,放进去个解说员如何？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I throw in an explainer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.31,0:15:46.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好 那太棒了 我得去检查一条留言{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that'd be super. Excuse me, I gotta check some messages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.86,0:15:50.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,自大狂{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.21,0:16:08.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,麦克基看到这个了吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has McG seen this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.75,0:16:14.05,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我喜欢这整体的身体彩绘 黑和白的配衬 但是 哦 我…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like the whole body-paint, black-and-white thing, but, gee...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.22,0:16:18.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不认为脖子上的那些伤口… 可以在摄像机上看清楚{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think those neck wounds are really gonna read on camera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.31,0:16:20.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,伤口得是红色的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They need to be red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.43,0:16:21.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你知道我在说什么吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I'm saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.14,0:16:24.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嗨 杰伊 我要和化妆师谈一谈{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Jay? I need you to speak to Makeup right away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.98,0:16:29.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么事？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.25,0:16:49.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.96,0:16:53.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们一定是在读了那本书的时候… 把他们引回来了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we read from that book, we must've brought them back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.26,0:16:54.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,从地狱中引回来了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back from hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.76,0:16:58.05,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是我不明白 如果鬼魂在地狱中 他们是如何听到圣歌的呢？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I don't understand. If they were in hell, how could they hear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.22,0:16:59.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他们一定有顺风耳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must have super hearing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.64,0:17:01.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这是哇{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the...? Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.56,0:17:04.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,噢 天呐{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, jeez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.47,0:17:41.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 温蒂？- 哦 米奇 上帝啊 你还活着{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wendy. - Oh, Mitch. God, you're alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.60,0:17:43.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你不会这么容易就把我甩掉的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You couldn't get rid of me that easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.47,0:17:45.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,争论 争论 争论{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rumble, rumble, rumble!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.19,0:17:48.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,盐 知道吗 我们需要盐{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Salt. Okay, we need salt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.31,0:17:51.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我在书中读到过 盐可以让鬼魂远离{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I read in that book that it keeps ghosts away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.32,0:17:54.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,桑德拉 洛根 你们检查后面{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sandra, Logan, you guys check the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.36,0:17:56.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那个可怜的混蛋自杀了 说真的…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jay, the poor bastard killed himself...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.40,0:17:59.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们难道不应该 关闭摄影棚或者什么吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like, for real. Shouldn't we shut it down or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.20,0:18:01.87,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们已经在吃早餐的时候 为他默哀了一会儿了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had a moment of silence for him at breakfast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.03,0:18:03.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他只是一个工作室的家伙而已{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was just a studio guy. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.74,0:18:05.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘘{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.33,0:18:08.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我爱你 - 我知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I love you. - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.00,0:18:10.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.04,0:18:14.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们… 我们能不能停机或者什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we-? Can we cut or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.46,0:18:18.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,呃… 是 停机 停机{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, uh, yeah, cut. Cut!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.18,0:18:19.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,停机{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.81,0:18:24.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,只有我能说停机{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only I can say, "cut."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.81,0:18:27.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嗨 怎么了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.39,0:18:29.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我只是有一点心烦意乱{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, I'm just a little upset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.31,0:18:32.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这里发生了这么多事 谁能责备你呢？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With everything that's been going on around here, who can blame you, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.02,0:18:35.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我只是不能把我的精神 集中在剧本对话上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just can't wrap my head around the dialogue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.53,0:18:37.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你知道吗？盐 难道听起来不傻吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, salt? Doesn't that sound silly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.03,0:18:40.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我意思是说 为什么一个鬼会惧怕盐呢？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, why would a ghost be afraid of salt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.36,0:18:42.41,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好的 呃…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.57,0:18:43.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 马蒂 - 哟{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Marty. - Yo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.74,0:18:45.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你怎么想的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.41,0:18:48.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不是非盐不娶 你想要什么？我们还要继续谈论调味品吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not married to salt. What do you want? We still sticking with condiments?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.71,0:18:51.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,只是听起来有些不同 并没有变好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mm, just sounds different. Not better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.58,0:18:54.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 一个鬼还会惧怕什么其他东西呢？- 哦 你一定是在和我开玩笑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What else would a ghost be scared of? - Uh, you gotta be kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.84,0:18:57.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,鬼会怕什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would a ghost be scared of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.46,0:19:00.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许是霰弹枪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe, uh-Maybe shotguns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.30,0:19:02.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那比盐还要不合乎逻辑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, that makes even less sense than salt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.89,0:19:06.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这些人都是白痴{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These people are idiots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.64,0:19:12.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 沃尔特做为一个私人助理 脾气有点暴躁 恩？- 这里怎么样了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Walter's a little testy for a PA, huh? - How's it going in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.77,0:19:15.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,很好 达拉的演技又有提高了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's going good. Tara's stepped up her performance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.36,0:19:17.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我认为是利用情景记忆得以提升的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably from all the sense memory she's drawing on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.11,0:19:19.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 情景记忆？- 是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sense memory? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:23.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 当我问你这里进行得如何的时候{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean.When I ask how it's going here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.57,0:19:24.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我所说的是案子 好吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm talking about the case, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.08,0:19:26.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们并不是真的在这里工作{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't really work here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.41,0:19:29.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,知道吗 我以为你讨厌做私人助理的工作{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I thought you hated being a PA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.29,0:19:34.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不知道 也并不是太坏 我感觉我是剧组中的一员了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. It's not so bad. I kind of feel like part of the team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.21,0:19:37.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这个不错 墨西哥卷？味道棒级了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good. Oh, taquito? They're wonderful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.92,0:19:41.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不了 呃… 听着 我偷溜进了停尸房{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, um, listen, I conned my way into the morgue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.05,0:19:43.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 怎么样 - 新闻报道是对的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And? - News reports are right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.97,0:19:45.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,布拉德死了 毫无疑问{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brad's a doornail, no question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.89,0:19:47.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,收到 对不起 什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that. Sorry, what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.56,0:19:48.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 收到？- 你刚刚说什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Copy that? - What'd you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.10,0:19:51.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 新闻报道是属实的 布拉德死了 - 他们都知道了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- News reports are right. Brad's a doornail. - They're aware.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.10,0:19:54.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 谁都知道了？- 对不起 你刚刚说什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's aware? - Sorry, what were you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.27,0:19:59.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,呃 呃 新闻报道是属实的 布拉德死了 这件事毫无疑问{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, what-The newspaper's right. Brad's a doornail, no question about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.23,0:20:00.99,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我猜我们没有掉下去是好事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a good thing we didn't skip town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.15,0:20:03.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,到这里来 我想让你听点东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come here. I want you to hear something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.74,0:20:05.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,收到 马上就到{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that. On my way.{\r}
