Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.39,0:21:15.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 这里就是那家伙从棚顶掉下来那段{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's where the guy fell through the roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.64,0:21:16.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
