Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.48,0:22:42.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,伊莉斯在9号摄影棚的木椽上 上吊自杀了 就死在他们拍摄的时候{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So Elise hangs herself from Stage 9's rafters right into a scene they're shooting.{\r}
