Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.86,0:27:03.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,今年夏天 他们再一次回来了…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this summer, they're coming back again to settle the score, again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.70,0:27:05.41,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你在这吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You out here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.41,0:27:11.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,艾希莉和托德 他们已经死了 温迪 他们已经死了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ashley and Todd, they're dead. Wendy, they're dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.21,0:27:13.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这些混蛋不带我们 就这么走了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These bastards aren't taking us. Not without a fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.84,0:27:15.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我现在就要离开这里了 布罗迪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm getting out of here now! Brodie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.21,0:27:20.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,从麦田屠杀者 怪物卡车{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the producers Of Cornfield Massacre, Monster Truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.59,0:27:23.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,还有查利的天使 查利的天使 全力以赴…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the director of Charlie's Angels, Charlie's Angels:Full Throttle...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.05,0:27:27.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,和来自地狱的阴霾 恐怖新体验{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Hell Hazers, comes a new experience in terror.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.23,0:27:32.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们一定把他们从地狱回来带回来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must've brought them back. Back from hell. Again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.90,0:27:36.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,地狱阴霾II 清算{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell Hazers II: The Reckoning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.40,0:27:38.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这本片子还没有被打分{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This film is not yet rated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.49,0:27:44.41,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,根据一个粉丝的说法{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run-in with a giant fan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.57,0:27:46.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,同样的事情在66年时 也发生在一个电工身上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same thing happened to an electrician back in '66.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.08,0:27:49.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 一个叫比利·比尔德的家伙 - 到底怎么回事呢 伙计{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Guy named Billy Beard. - What the hell, dude?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.75,0:27:52.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不知道 这一次看上去 不像是伊莉斯干的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Doesn't seem like Elise this time. It's not her m.o.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.87,0:27:55.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们已经烧了她了 我们是在对付另外一个鬼？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We torched her. Are we dealing with another ghost?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.29,0:27:57.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 可能是 - 但是这些东西 通常不会小组行动的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe. - Yeah, these things don't usually tag team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.72,0:28:04.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,所有人 都过来一下 好吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody, gather around, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.30,0:28:07.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我有件事要宣布一下 帮我拿着{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got an announcement to make. Hold that for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.56,0:28:10.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,所有人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.10,0:28:12.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,靠近一点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}huddle in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.31,0:28:17.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,因为昨晚杰伊的意外{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In light of Jay's accident last night...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.11,0:28:21.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,以及要同当局进行协调合作{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and in cooperation with the authorities...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.28,0:28:23.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们要停工几天{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're shutting down production for a few days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.28,0:28:26.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.95,0:28:30.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,听着 我不会对你们说谎 这个礼拜我们是遇到了一些挫折{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm not gonna lie to you, we've had a few setbacks this week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.29,0:28:35.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是我们都知道杰伊和布拉德 最想要什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we all know what Jay and Brad wanted more than anything...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.46,0:28:39.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那就是让地狱阴霾II 清算{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that was to see Hell Hazers II: The Reckoning...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.30,0:28:41.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在全美的大银幕上公映{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on screens all across America.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.17,0:28:45.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,现在 是我们欠他们 所以要继续努力{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, we owe it to them to go on and to pull together...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.14,0:28:49.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,团结一心 拍摄好这部该死的电影 恩？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and make this damn movie, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.47,0:28:53.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是… 但是… 不是今天{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not-Not today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.77,0:28:55.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,回家去 有人会给你们打电话的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go home. Someone will call you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.52,0:28:57.52,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我会带着那个的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I'll take that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.73,0:29:02.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,温蒂 不要{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wendy, don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.74,0:29:04.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,怎么了？你在害怕吗？怕鬼？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, are you afraid of ghosts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.49,0:29:06.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了啦 这会很好玩的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, it'll be fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.53,0:29:09.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对不起 我还能再去吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, can I go again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.12,0:29:11.41,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 好的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.58,0:29:13.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.50,0:29:16.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么 你找到那个电工埋哪儿了吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you find out where the electrician's buried?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.67,0:29:19.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他没埋在哪儿 比利·伯德是被火化的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wasn't. Billy Beard was cremated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.00,0:29:22.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,太好了 现在怎么办？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. Now what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.67,0:29:23.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.09,0:29:26.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有任何鬼影在母带里吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any more ghost cameos in the dailies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.76,0:29:28.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,前六个小时没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not in the first six hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.85,0:29:31.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 也许那些鬼魂{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, maybe the spirits are...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.89,0:29:34.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,想让这部电影叫停 因为他们认为电影很讨厌{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}trying to shut down the movie because they think it sucks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.02,0:29:36.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,因为 我的意思是 确实挺讨厌的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because, I mean, it kind of does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.27,0:29:39.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,"来吧" "会很有趣的"那句开始{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McG "Come on, it'll be fun."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.19,0:29:41.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,来吧 这会很有趣的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, it'll be fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.16,0:29:57.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,注意听咒语{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to the invocation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.21,0:30:01.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 那是真的咒语{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, that's the real deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.67,0:30:03.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一个召唤式的巫术咒语{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A necromantic summoning ritual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.97,0:30:09.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这种东西出现在一部 好莱坞电影里是要干嘛？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is that doing in a Hollywood movie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.72,0:30:13.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 亲爱的 我们要停工几天 再开工的时间不定{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, dude, we're down for a few days. Force majeure. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.56,0:30:16.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,很好 这会给我时间去 弄一下那个时间旅行的东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's cool, it gives me time to pitch that time-travel thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.56,0:30:19.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 好吧 听着 你再打给我谈这件事情 好吗？我是说真的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. All right, well, look, get back to me on this, seriously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.81,0:30:21.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 我是认真的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm serious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.52,0:30:24.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,老兄 你是认真的吗？因为我是讲真的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, are you serious? Because I'm serious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.40,0:30:26.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧 很好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.44,0:30:28.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,伙计们 我们已经停工了 你们还在这干嘛？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, we're all shut down. What are you still doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.86,0:30:31.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 呃…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, um, just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.53,0:30:34.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,真的很抱歉 老兄 我… 我们就是控制不了自己{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, man. We-We-We couldn't help ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.12,0:30:37.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们得告诉你我们看了剧本{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just had to tell you that we read the script.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.54,0:30:38.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,然后？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.46,0:30:41.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.71,0:30:44.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 精彩绝伦 - 精彩绝伦{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's, uh-It's awesome. - Awesome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.09,0:30:47.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 真的精彩绝伦 - 我知道 真的是无以伦比的 对吧？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really awesome. - I know, it's pretty rocking, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.76,0:30:50.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我很高兴你们喜欢它 - 是的 我真的很喜欢所有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm glad you guys liked it. - Yeah, I really liked, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.59,0:30:52.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在细节方面的注重{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all the attention to detail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.26,0:30:53.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,伙计 没错 那就是我的特点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, right on, that's my thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.45,0:30:55.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 你知道的 算是我的罪恶好了 但那就是我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, color me guilty, but that is me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.81,0:30:57.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是个绝对的细节专家{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I'm a total detail buff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.60,0:31:01.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 我看的出来 从你导演的方式 所有那些召唤仪式{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I can tell. The way you worked in all those Enochian summoning rituals...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.19,0:31:03.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,还有那些正统语言还有…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in all the authentic language, and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.44,0:31:04.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么 你是说那些拉丁语的废话？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you mean that Latin crap?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.49,0:31:08.99,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 兄弟 那是沃尔特做的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, man. That's Walter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.15,0:31:11.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,沃尔特·狄克逊 原作者{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walter Dixon, the original writer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.78,0:31:12.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你喜欢那些垃圾？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like that garbage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.12,0:31:14.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,等一下 沃尔特？那个私人助理沃尔特？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, Walter the PA, Walter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.66,0:31:18.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 他不是私人助理 他的合约有一条条款 让他能来拍摄现场{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not a PA. He's got a clause in his contract that allows him to come on set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.62,0:31:19.96,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是是他写的那些咒语？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he wrote the invocations?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.12,0:31:22.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他写了一本很呆的剧本 没剧情的铺垫{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wrote a whack-job screenplay. There's no pace...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.63,0:31:24.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没有爱情看点 都是些疯子一样的说明{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no love interest, it's all wackadoo exposition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.96,0:31:27.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我要剪切掉 大概90%的东西去让它能被读懂{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cut like 90 percent of it to make it readable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.51,0:31:29.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,然后另外10%去让它变得好看{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another 10 percent to make it good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.51,0:31:37.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,应该保存沃尔特的原始剧本的 事实上还挺不错的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should've kept Walter's original script. It's actually pretty good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.47,0:31:38.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.77,0:31:42.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,读上去像是召唤术的学习手册一样{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it reads like a how-to manual of conjuration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.40,0:31:45.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就像是一本教你 如何召唤鬼魂的教科书{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a textbook on how to summon ghosts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.78,0:31:46.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,然后让它们为你去做任何事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and get them to do whatever you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.32,0:31:48.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 是啊 就像去杀人 - 是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, like kill people. - Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.99,0:31:53.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,所以假设在某段时期 沃尔特学了一些非常黑暗的巫术{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's say somewhere down the line Walter learned some Black Magic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.32,0:31:56.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 然后我们假设 他被那些人给惹火了 因为他们搞砸了他的电影{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, and let's say he's pissed at these people for wrecking his movie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.87,0:31:58.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,动机和手段都有了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Motive and means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.37,0:31:59.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,值得去查清楚{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's worth checking out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.21,0:32:12.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.59,0:32:14.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你想要会面？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you wanted to meet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.43,0:32:19.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 我有点忙呢 兄弟 我在改剧本{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I'm a little busy here, buddy. I'm working on a script.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.35,0:32:21.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 是啊 你们经常改动剧本{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, you guys worked on it a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.60,0:32:24.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,需要改动 那么为什么我们不能 在我的办公室里谈这些呢？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It needed work. Why couldn't we have done this in my office?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.56,0:32:28.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你知道 历史 那些在我的草稿里的知识 都是完全准确的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know the history, the lore in my draft was completely accurate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.61,0:32:31.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们可以在刚开始的时候 就把一切都做对的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could've gotten it right for the first time ever...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.03,0:32:33.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在这里 这个镇的堕落之地{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in this whorehouse of a town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.82,0:32:36.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是把它当垃圾一样粉碎了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you tore it to shreds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.24,0:32:41.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你用艳俗和狗屁一样的玩笑来代替它{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You replaced it with cleavage and fart jokes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.04,0:32:43.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那些都是真实{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.21,0:32:45.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,谁在乎真实不真实？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who gives a rat's ass about real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.75,0:32:48.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们在谈论鬼 沃尔特 根本就没有那种东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're talking about ghosts here, there's no such thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.21,0:32:50.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那就是你搞错的地方 马丁{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's where you're wrong, Martin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.06,0:33:05.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 白痴 会面结束{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, nut job. End of meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.24,0:33:18.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,噢 天啊 不 求你 不要{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God, no. Please, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.16,0:33:23.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你毁了它 马丁 我致力于的所有的东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ruined it, Martin. Everything I worked for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.91,0:33:26.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 上帝 沃尔特{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God! Walter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.54,0:33:28.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,现在你就要知道做鬼的滋味了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna find out what being a ghost is like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.79,0:33:30.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,沃尔特 求你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walter, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.75,0:33:32.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,沃尔特 救我 救命{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walter, help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.18,0:33:45.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你真是个非同一般的私人助理{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are one hell of a PA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.77,0:33:47.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是啊 我知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.98,0:33:50.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们要干什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.44,0:33:51.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这句话该我来问你 沃尔特{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could ask you the same thing.Walter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.19,0:33:54.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,把那些鬼魂召唤回来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raising these spirits from the dead...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.78,0:33:57.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,让他们为你杀人 那是在玩火 沃尔特{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}making them murder for you, that's playing with fire, Walter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.57,0:34:00.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你不明白{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.95,0:34:03.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你知道吗？你是对的 我不明白{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what, you're right, I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.95,0:34:08.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,等等 听着 你倾注你的一切在某件事上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, look, you put your heart and soul into something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.96,0:34:12.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,多少年的努力 多少年 然后他们拿走了它{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Years of hard work. Years. And then they take it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.63,0:34:15.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,并且完全的毁它{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they crap all over it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.63,0:34:18.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,然后 然后他们还希望你笑着跟他们说谢谢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then-And then they want you to smile and say thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.93,0:34:20.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,沃尔特 听着 那只是部电影 仅仅如此{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walter, listen, it's just a movie. That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.97,0:34:26.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你瞧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.85,0:34:30.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我对你们没有敌意 你们与此无关{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got nothing against you, man. You're not part of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.31,0:34:32.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,求你们了 求求你们了 离开吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just please, please, just leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.07,0:34:34.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是马丁要留下{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Martings gotta stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.65,0:34:36.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对不起 不能这么做{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, can't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.40,0:34:40.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不是说我们喜欢他或者怎么样 这是原则问题{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not that we like him or anything, it's just a matter of principle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.32,0:34:42.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么我也对不起了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I'm sorry too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.83,0:34:45.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,沃尔特 沃尔特 求你… 不要{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walter. Walter, pl-Don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.18,0:35:07.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.65,0:35:13.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,狗娘…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a..{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.19,0:35:18.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,来吧 来吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.21,0:35:31.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,快 快 快走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on, move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.68,0:35:49.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,"来海边吧" "我们聚一起 乐一乐"{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Come to the coast, we'll get together, have a few laughs."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.06,0:35:55.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 可恶{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.98,0:35:59.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我简直不能相信 居然真的有鬼 - 什么让你认为这世界上没鬼的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't believe these ghosts are real. What makes you say that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.58,0:36:11.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是我不明白{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.75,0:36:13.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,沃尔特是怎么控制它们的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is Walter controlling them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.75,0:36:15.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,可能是那个护身符{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably with that talisman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.72,0:36:23.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你在干什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.89,0:36:26.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果摄像机能捕捉到 这些东西的影像…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, if film cameras pick these suckers up, then...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.10,0:36:29.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,可能… 呃…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.77,0:36:35.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 那边{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, right there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.57,0:36:39.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,打中了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.99,0:36:42.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 在那边{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, right there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.66,0:36:50.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 拿着 知道怎么用了吗？- 是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here, you get the idea? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.37,0:36:52.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 你们拖着它们 我去追沃尔特{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, you hold them off, I'm going after Walter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.34,0:37:00.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我没法相信还有灵魂存在 - 是有灵魂的 好吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I cannot believe there's an afterlife. - There's an afterlife, all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.92,0:37:03.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是通常都是让人如坐针毡{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But mostly it's a pain in the ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.80,0:37:05.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.10,0:37:11.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,结束了 沃尔特{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over, Walter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.97,0:37:13.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,现在 把那东西给我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, give it to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.69,0:37:19.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那里 好了 现在没人可以得到它了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There, okay, now no one can have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.11,0:37:24.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 如果我是你的话我绝不会这么做 - 是吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I wouldn't have done that if I were you. - Oh, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.49,0:37:25.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 为什么不？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - And why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.11,0:37:27.41,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,因为你刚刚释放了它们{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you just freed them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.41,0:37:30.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们现在无法阻止它们了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't stop them now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.83,0:37:32.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,沃尔特 你把它们带了回来…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walter, you brought them back...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.25,0:37:34.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,强迫它们杀人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}forced them to murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.96,0:37:37.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,它们不会对你有好感的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not gonna be very happy with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.17,0:37:39.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是吗？所以呢 为什么没有？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, so why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.40,0:38:06.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 上帝{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.45,0:38:08.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 上帝{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.82,0:38:11.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.45,0:38:15.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是我不明白 为什么灵魂能显现在手机相机上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand, how can the spirits appear in the camera phone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.71,0:38:18.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一定是摄相机能捕捉到… 我们的眼睛捕捉不到的频率{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The video must pick up their frequencies in a way that our eyes can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.09,0:38:24.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在那里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.72,0:38:30.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,停机 哦 收录好那段 那会放到电影里去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut! Oh, print that one. That's in the movie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.30,0:38:32.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 我爱它 孩子们 我爱它{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, loved it, kids. Loved it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.85,0:38:39.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你发现了鬼魂的存在 然后这就是你用它所做的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You find out there's an afterlife, and this is what you do with it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.15,0:38:42.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我需要在剧本上加点亮点嘛{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I needed a little jazz on the page.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.96,0:39:03.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你真是个非同一般的私人助理{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're one hell of a PA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.30,0:39:07.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.38,0:39:10.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.78,0:39:36.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,上帝啊 我爱这个小镇{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, I love this town.{\r}
